<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-SWEDEN BEAT LITHUANIA 1-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWEDEN BEAT LITHUANIA 1-0.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden beat Lithuania 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Martin Dahlin 33</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,043</p>
